  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "創新服務與實踐",
    "sub_ename": "INNOVATION SERVICE AND IMPLEMENTATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在令學生瞭解創新管理之相關學理及觀念，以能融會貫通並運用於服務創新。藉由小組團隊學習方式進行相關議題研討，引導不同背景領域的管理者挖掘自屬實務經驗，進而反向認識及歸納『創新服務與實踐』之訴求與特性，含實踐創新服務模式時，所會面臨的問題及解決之道，以培養相關專業修養及宏觀，並能融會貫通應用於各種經營與管理環境。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to enable students to understand the relevant theories and concepts of innovation management, so that students can integrate and apply them to service innovation.  Through group team learning, relevant topics are discussed, and students from different backgrounds are guided to explore their own practical experience and then can understand and generalize the issues and characteristics of innovation service and implementation which includes the problems and solutions of implementing innovation service model.  So as to cultivate relevant professional training and macroscopic view, students then can be able to face various environments.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "分析創新服務之訴求與趨勢",
      "describe_en": "Analyzing the issues and trend of innovation service"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "實踐創新服務模式的能力",
      "describe_en": "Implementing innovation service model"
    }
